I left out the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm`, so it has no `http-client` import to call `metadata.internal.example` through. Sending the feed item's text to an external URL would also let untrusted content leave the node, which the confinement is meant to prevent.

